<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:02:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>Amazon data center communities: Here’s what’s happening near data centers across the US</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how Amazon supports small businesses, creates jobs, sets up sustainability initiatives, and develops educational programs near AWS data centers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6081627/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2962x2962+1155+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fa3%2Ff6%2F0abb1c1a4734ba2e727893e6eae2%2Faws-data-center-exterior-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 16:47:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Massachusetts</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-massachusetts-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Bay State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for those who call Massachusetts home. </description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:58:11 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-massachusetts-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/2061e55/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F63%2Fcb%2Fe41ecc5b42449c262d7837a05812%2Fabout-amazon-hero-boston-adobestock-213946896.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Missouri</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-missouri-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting Missouri’s economy while creating opportunities for Missourians. </description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:56:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-missouri-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/5051b01/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe7%2F1b%2F55189ef04ea69c1432bd64b3a8b0%2Fabout-amazon-hero-hannibal-adobestock-680684590.jpg"/></item><item><title>Prime Video and the Television Academy announce 6-year deal to exclusively stream the Emmy Awards globally</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-emmy-awards-deal?utm_source=rss</link><description>Beginning in 2027, the Emmy Awards will stream live and free on Prime Video in more than 240 countries and territories—the first time the ceremony has had a single, dedicated home.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 12:58:12 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-emmy-awards-deal</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a09aaa3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F6b%2F3a%2F0dfc8995438a941ee165f65bb8e6%2Fprimevideo-emmys-streaming-amazonnews-cdlt-10-5-2026.png"/></item><item><title>Prime Big Deal Days 2026 is here: 150 of the best deals to shop now through October 7</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals?utm_source=rss</link><description>From tech and toys to kitchen, beauty, and fall fashion, here are the top deals to shop during the 48-hour event, running through 11:59 p.m. PDT on Wednesday, October 7.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:22:02 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/bd3f583/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F29%2Fbb%2Fc41b88d6492890380feaf04dccc6%2Fpbdd-2026-best-deals-hero2-amazon-news-lt.gif"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Connecticut</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Constitution State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for Connecticut residents. </description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:44:55 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4ec094a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe1%2F08%2Fa2588bcb41629279981998e84117%2Fabout-amazon-hero-new-haven-adobestock-475790017.jpg"/></item><item><title>Inside the AWS lab that makes everything you do online feel effortless</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/inside-aws-networking-lab-cupertino?utm_source=rss</link><description>In a nondescript building in Cupertino, California, a team of engineers is quietly designing the networking technology that keeps the modern world connected—one wavelength of light at a time.</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 15:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/inside-aws-networking-lab-cupertino</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a2d8779/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F07%2F51%2F7195a5ad434483ecc2c501cf391e%2F2026-awsnetworking-preview-video011-amazon-news-lj-20261002.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon&apos;s Holiday Kids Gift Book is back with 600+ toys, games, and gifts for every age</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-2026-holiday-kids-gift-book?utm_source=rss</link><description>From an interactive Alexa+ story to exclusive Forest Friends gifts, this year&apos;s edition has something for everyone on your list.</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 13:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-2026-holiday-kids-gift-book</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/9009498/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fc8%2Fd2%2Fa349d72140c9bd9bf1384b893d71%2Famazon-holiday-kids-gift-book-hero.jpg"/></item><item><title>The race our nation can’t afford to lose, plus a new commitment from us and a fresh set of community investments</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together?utm_source=rss</link><description></description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:55:14 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/eb94cec/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F12%2F26%2F200746cc4971855f5828ce07fb38%2Famazondatacenteremployee-hero-amazonnews-ck92926.png"/></item></channel></rss>